# Local `go build ./cmd/thetisctl` output -- this module's binary shares its
# name with the module (go.mod: `module thetisctl`), so `go build` with no
# `-o` drops a `thetisctl` executable right here. Prebuilt binaries are
# distributed via GitHub Releases (see .github/workflows/release.yml), not
# committed to the tree.
/thetisctl
/thetisctl.exe
/dist/

# Other common local Go build/test artifacts, in case they ever show up here.
*.test
*.out
